# The table of items ForeverDiff still needs a contribution for, written by `wfd build` and put
# into the download zip at request time. It is data, not code: it is never committed, and a zip
# served while the site could not fetch it simply has no such file - the client skips a listed
# file that is not there and the addon adds no tooltip line. It is loaded FIRST so that the
# addon's own file can read it at load.
ForeverDiffData.lua
